'''Allix is located at -148.92, 273.53, 3.19'''

You say, 'Hail, Allix'

: Allix says, 'Rrraaarrrr!  Hello. You come to study from [mighty warrior], yes?'

You say, 'Are you the mighty warrior?'

: Allix says, 'Errrr.  Well, Allix not yet mighty warrior, but soon, yes.  Allix just come of age and soon will enter training to become mighty pasdar.  Errr... Allix little nervous.  Allix missing [one thing] to become mighty pasdar.'

You say, 'What is that one thing?'

: Allix says, 'Well, Allix not have to have but is good.  Is leaf.  Ajrah leaf.  Powerful magic in the leaf.  Pasdar holds next to body, keeps body strong and mind clear.  Not have to have but pasdar without ajrah leaf is poor pasdar. Kobolds in Erudite forrrest carry leaf, use in kobold magic. But Allix not mighty enough to fight kobold shamans for leaf.'

